        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk embroidered with silk and gold thread in satin stitch and shaded gold.  Depicting an apostle with a book inscribed 'GLORIA IN EXCELSIS DEO'.  The execution is of the highest quality and, in the flesh parts, of an almost incredible delicacy."@en ;
